# With no charge counters, the Battery can tap for exactly one red mana (CR 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Red Mana Battery
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Red Mana Battery.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Red Mana Battery.Activate(Ability: Remove any number; X: 0)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Red Mana Battery.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Red Mana Battery.Counters.Charge = (absent)
